WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.927 --> 00:00:03.436
- I don't really feel anything yet.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.619
- (laughs) Then take another one.

00:00:05.619 --> 00:00:08.844
(epic music)

00:00:20.773 --> 00:00:22.012
- Le Petite Crepe.

00:00:22.613 --> 00:00:23.865
- I don't really feel like reading.

00:00:23.865 --> 00:00:24.656
- Ok.

00:00:24.656 --> 00:00:26.219
- Oh, Enemy Buds?

00:00:26.219 --> 00:00:28.402
- No, Kevin James reminds me of my Dad.

00:00:28.402 --> 00:00:30.004
What about Man Child 2?

00:00:30.004 --> 00:00:31.002
- I don't really like

00:00:31.002 --> 00:00:33.624
lowest common denominator stoner comedies.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:37.858
- No.

00:00:39.321 --> 00:00:40.952
- Can you go and get the tickets for me?

00:00:40.952 --> 00:00:42.888
- No, you owe me money!

00:00:44.329 --> 00:00:47.044
- Hi, could I get-- (laughs)

00:00:48.485 --> 00:00:50.436
I got two for Space Reindeer.

00:00:50.436 --> 00:00:52.247
- Why?

00:00:52.247 --> 00:00:53.963
Ugh, it's Dreamworks.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.194
- Tickets?

00:00:56.194 --> 00:00:58.051
- Uh, yeah.

00:00:58.051 --> 00:01:00.004
Hey, Brittany, do you have the tickets?

00:01:00.857 --> 00:01:02.181
- No, you have the tickets.

00:01:02.181 --> 00:01:03.133
- I can't seem to find them.

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:04.271
- Do I have the tickets?

00:01:05.624 --> 00:01:07.217
- I just had them.

00:01:07.217 --> 00:01:08.169
- Do you have my phone?

00:01:08.169 --> 00:01:09.562
- These people saw me, you saw me, I--

00:01:09.562 --> 00:01:11.350
- I lost my phone.

00:01:12.766 --> 00:01:14.693
- Ok, um--

00:01:14.693 --> 00:01:16.296
- Where are they?

00:01:17.665 --> 00:01:20.045
Retrace your steps!

00:01:20.796 --> 00:01:22.821
- Oh, I got them.

00:01:22.821 --> 00:01:24.435
They're right here.

00:01:24.435 --> 00:01:25.259
- Enjoy your show.

00:01:25.259 --> 00:01:27.017
- You too!

00:01:27.901 --> 00:01:28.853
- I can't stop smiling.

00:01:28.853 --> 00:01:30.455
- I'm really starting to feel it now.

00:01:30.455 --> 00:01:33.301
I hope I don't run in to anyone I know.

00:01:33.311 --> 00:01:34.913
- Is that Brittany?

00:01:34.913 --> 00:01:35.865
Brittany Ashley?

00:01:35.865 --> 00:01:38.372
Oh my gosh, we keep
running in to each other!

00:01:38.372 --> 00:01:39.301
Oh hey man, how are you?

00:01:39.301 --> 00:01:40.671
- Hi, yeah.

00:01:40.671 --> 00:01:42.088
- Yeah, I was just taking
Artemio's little brother

00:01:42.088 --> 00:01:43.388
out to see a movie.

00:01:43.388 --> 00:01:44.688
We're seeing Space Reindeer!

00:01:44.688 --> 00:01:46.174
- Oh my God, we're seeing Space--

00:01:46.174 --> 00:01:47.567
- Man Child 2.

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:49.239
Uh, so we definitely
can't sit next to you,

00:01:49.239 --> 00:01:51.375
I have to find my phone
and use the bathroom.

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:53.902
Ok, I gotta go.

00:01:53.906 --> 00:01:55.538
- Both of us have allergies,

00:01:55.538 --> 00:01:57.186
contact lens problems,

00:01:57.186 --> 00:01:58.928
we were crying a lot too, so.

00:01:58.928 --> 00:02:00.692
- Yeah we were crying a lot today too.

00:02:00.692 --> 00:02:03.827
He's the strongest little guy I know.

00:02:03.827 --> 00:02:04.779
- I think I took too much.

00:02:04.779 --> 00:02:06.265
It's like, oh, and it's
just now kicking in?

00:02:06.265 --> 00:02:07.612
Am I going to be this high forever?

00:02:07.612 --> 00:02:09.469
Kevin James...

00:02:09.469 --> 00:02:12.121
Can you overdose on weed?

00:02:12.998 --> 00:02:14.451
- Oh hey cool hat by the way!

00:02:14.451 --> 00:02:15.472
(laughs) We actually picked up

00:02:15.472 --> 00:02:17.144
a couple of these too.

00:02:17.144 --> 00:02:18.491
These'll be our movie hats, huh, bud?

00:02:18.491 --> 00:02:19.466
(explosion)

00:02:19.466 --> 00:02:21.471
- He's the strongest little kid I know.

00:02:22.209 --> 00:02:23.294
- Cool.

00:02:23.294 --> 00:02:25.354
- I've gotta find Chris.

00:02:26.938 --> 00:02:29.519
- No movie could be
better than that preview.

00:02:30.581 --> 00:02:34.343
(movie soundtrack)

00:02:39.964 --> 00:02:41.023
- Sorry to leave you hanging,

00:02:41.023 --> 00:02:42.797
he was really creepy.

00:02:42.797 --> 00:02:43.958
- Oh, your friend Chris?

00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:45.535
He seems fine.

00:02:48.216 --> 00:02:51.342
- Artemio would have loved this CGI.

00:02:51.342 --> 00:02:53.293
That's Hitchcock's Vertigo zoom.

00:02:53.293 --> 00:02:54.686
I don't know if he's watching the film,

00:02:54.686 --> 00:02:57.249
I think he just likes being a dark room.

00:02:58.579 --> 00:03:03.101
(peppy music)

